<p id="Sx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This work was supported by the National Key R&amp;D Program of China (2024YFB3311600) and the Natural Science Foundation of Henan (252300423936).

<span id="Sx1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></p>
</div>
</section>
